- The NRA in the Member State in which the Market Participant involved in the potential breach has registered (in the Centralised European Register of Energy Market Participants, CEREMP).

If a single NRA meets both criteria, only that NRA should be notified. Otherwise all those NRAs that meet at least one of the criteria should be notified.

