7.1. Introduction

(346) This chapter provides guidance to NRAs concerning the application of the obligations on notifying algorithmic trading and direct electronic access under the REMIT revision. The Subchapters 7.2 and 7.3 illustrate the Agency's current understanding of what falls in and what falls out of-scope of notification for both algorithmic trading and direct electronic access. Further, relevant parties' notification responsibilities are clarified, enhancing compliance and transparency.

